~ start
You are a General of Ask'lan, the Golden City of the Deltas, the center of the world, of opulent palaces, bustling markets and far-splayed vineyards. In Ask'lan, every day is a blessed day, for it is home of the King of the greatest esteem, an absolute master. Through His benevolence, He brought prosperity to the glimmering deltas of the river Denial, and now desires to extend it to the entire world.

You were at the King's side for as long as you remember, compelled by your regal blood. A hand of justice, you were always loved by your men and the common folk alike. Now, so you are told, your beloved City is threatened by insidious forces that seek to overturn its peace for a evil cause. To nip such forces in the bud in the King's will, and your command.
=> END